- All tasks completed
- All tasks failed
- No tasks in file
- No Tasks section
- Mixed parent and leaf tasks
- Tasks in code blocks (should be ignored)
- Blank lines between tasks
- Parent tasks marked complete with incomplete children
- File not found error handling
- Clean output format (no extra whitespace)

